# How to install Postgres on your local  
  1. 'install brew and update it frist'
      brew update
  2.  Install Postgres using below command
      brew install postgresql@15

      Note : We can change the Postgres Version from as per the requirement @15, @16, @17, @18...

  3. Verify the installation. 
      /opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@15/bin/postgres --version

      expected output will be : postgres (PostgreSQL) 15.x
